{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":6,"lang":"id","title":"Apa yang dilakukan orang","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Apa yang akan kamu pelajari","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Sampai sekarang kalimatnya tentang seperti apa dan di mana seseorang: I am ready, it is here. Sekarang kamu akan bercerita apa yang dilakukan orang: «aku bekerja di apotek», «kami memotong rumput», «dia menyetir ke kantor». Ini hal yang berulang: pekerjaan, kebiasaan, rutinitas."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I work in a pharmacy.","translation":"Aku bekerja di apotek.","hi":"work"},{"en":"We mow the lawn.","translation":"Kami memotong rumput.","hi":"mow"},{"en":"He drives to work.","translation":"Dia menyetir ke kantor.","hi":"drives"},{"en":"She teaches English.","translation":"Dia mengajar bahasa Inggris.","hi":"teaches"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"Siapa + kegiatan","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Di sini am, is, are tidak dipakai. Kegiatan langsung sesudah «siapa»: I work, we bake. Sama seperti «aku bekerja» — tanpa kata tambahan. I am work itu salah."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"siapa","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan","accent":true},{"text":"apa / di mana / kapan","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I work in a pharmacy.","translation":"Aku bekerja di apotek.","hi":"work"},{"en":"I bake bread.","translation":"Aku memanggang roti.","hi":"bake"},{"en":"You sweep the floor.","translation":"Kamu menyapu lantai.","hi":"sweep"},{"en":"We trim the hedge.","translation":"Kami memangkas pagar tanaman.","hi":"trim"},{"en":"They build a wall.","translation":"Mereka membangun tembok.","hi":"build"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am work in a pharmacy.","right":"I work in a pharmacy."},{"wrong":"We are trim the hedge.","right":"We trim the hedge."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Kamu bercerita di mana kamu bekerja. Mana yang benar?","optionA":"I am work in a pharmacy.","optionB":"I work in a pharmacy.","correct":"B","explain":"Kalau ada kegiatan, tidak perlu am: I work."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"I, you, we, they — kegiatan seperti di kamus","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Dengan I, you, we, dan they kegiatannya tetap seperti di kamus: work, wash, carry. Di sini mirip bahasa Indonesia: kata kerjanya tidak berubah."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I wash the plates.","translation":"Aku mencuci piring.","hi":"wash"},{"en":"You carry the trays.","translation":"Kamu membawa nampan.","hi":"carry"},{"en":"We pick pears.","translation":"Kami memetik pir.","hi":"pick"},{"en":"They dig in the yard.","translation":"Mereka menggali di halaman.","hi":"dig"},{"en":"We play football in the yard.","translation":"Kami main sepak bola di halaman.","hi":"play"},{"en":"I ride a bicycle.","translation":"Aku naik sepeda.","hi":"ride"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"We picks pears.","right":"We pick pears."},{"wrong":"They digs in the yard.","right":"They dig in the yard."}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"He, she, it — di akhir muncul s","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Ini yang beda dari bahasa Indonesia. Dengan he, she, it, atau satu orang — the host, my brother — kegiatannya ditambah s: he drives, she waits, the host greets. Karena kata kerja kita tidak berubah, s ini gampang terlupa: She wait salah."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"he / she / it / satu orang","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan + s","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"He drives to work.","translation":"Dia menyetir ke kantor.","hi":"drives"},{"en":"She waits at the bus stop.","translation":"Dia menunggu di halte.","hi":"waits"},{"en":"She smiles at the baby.","translation":"Dia tersenyum pada bayi.","hi":"smiles"},{"en":"He tastes the soup.","translation":"Dia mencicipi sup.","hi":"tastes"},{"en":"The host greets the guests.","translation":"Tuan rumah menyambut tamu.","hi":"greets"},{"en":"It sleeps on the quilt.","translation":"Dia tidur di atas selimut. *(kucing)*","hi":"sleeps"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She wait at the bus stop.","right":"She waits at the bus stop."},{"wrong":"He drive to work.","right":"He drives to work."},{"wrong":"I works in a pharmacy.","right":"I work in a pharmacy."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"at the bus stop.","options":["wait","waits","is wait"],"answer":"waits","why":"Dengan she, kegiatannya ditambah s."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"Kapan pakai es","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kalau kegiatan berakhir dengan sh, ch, s, atau x, s saja tidak bisa diucapkan: tambah es, dan muncul satu suku kata. wash → washes, catch → catches, teach → teaches, fish → fishes, mix → mixes."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She teaches English.","translation":"Dia mengajar bahasa Inggris.","hi":"teaches"},{"en":"She catches the bus.","translation":"Dia sempat naik bus.","hi":"catches"},{"en":"He fishes with a rod.","translation":"Dia memancing dengan joran.","hi":"fishes"},{"en":"She washes the saucers.","translation":"Dia mencuci tatakan cangkir.","hi":"washes"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She teachs English.","right":"She teaches English."},{"wrong":"He fishs with a rod.","right":"He fishes with a rod."}]}]},{"num":"06","title":"Kapan y berubah jadi ies","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kalau kegiatan berakhir dengan y dan sebelumnya konsonan, y diganti ies: study → studies, carry → carries. Kalau sebelum y ada vokal, cukup s: play → plays."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She studies with a tutor.","translation":"Dia belajar dengan guru les.","hi":"studies"},{"en":"My brother carries a bundle.","translation":"Kakakku membawa buntelan.","hi":"carries"},{"en":"He plays football.","translation":"Dia main sepak bola.","hi":"plays"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She studys with a tutor.","right":"She studies with a tutor."},{"wrong":"He plaies football.","right":"He plays football."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"with a tutor.","options":["studys","studies","study"],"answer":"studies","why":"Sebelum y ada konsonan d, jadi y berubah jadi ies."}}]},{"num":"07","title":"Untuk hal yang rutin","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kalimat seperti ini tentang pekerjaan, kebiasaan, dan hal yang berulang: I walk to work — «aku jalan kaki ke kantor» (biasanya, tiap hari). Bukan tentang yang sedang terjadi detik ini."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I walk to work.","translation":"Aku jalan kaki ke kantor.","hi":"walk"},{"en":"I cycle to work.","translation":"Aku bersepeda ke kantor.","hi":"cycle"},{"en":"I exercise at home.","translation":"Aku olahraga di rumah.","hi":"exercise"},{"en":"She lives in a flat.","translation":"Dia tinggal di apartemen.","hi":"lives"},{"en":"They sell lamps.","translation":"Mereka menjual lampu.","hi":"sell"}]}]},{"num":"08","title":"Di mana dan kapan — di akhir","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Di mana dan kapan biasanya di akhir kalimat: I start at two — «aku mulai jam dua», She reads in the armchair — «dia membaca di kursi berlengan». Jam pakai at: at two, at five. Bukan in atau on."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I start at two.","translation":"Aku mulai jam dua.","hi":"at"},{"en":"I arrive at five.","translation":"Aku sampai jam lima.","hi":"at"},{"en":"She leaves at four.","translation":"Dia pergi jam empat.","hi":"at"},{"en":"She reads in the armchair.","translation":"Dia membaca di kursi berlengan.","hi":"in"},{"en":"We jog at sunrise.","translation":"Kami jogging saat matahari terbit.","hi":"at"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I start in two.","right":"I start at two."},{"wrong":"I start on two.","right":"I start at two."}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Kegiatan atau penjepit — jangan dua-duanya","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kalau ada kegiatan, tidak pakai am, is, are: She cooks. Kalau tidak ada kegiatan dan kamu bilang siapa atau seperti apa seseorang, perlu is dan a: He is a baker. Kita cukup bilang «Dia pembuat roti», tapi He baker tidak lengkap."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She is an artist.","translation":"Dia seniman.","hi":"is"},{"en":"This artist paints portraits.","translation":"Seniman ini melukis potret.","hi":"paints"},{"en":"He is a baker.","translation":"Dia pembuat roti.","hi":"is"},{"en":"The tailor repairs uniforms.","translation":"Penjahit itu memperbaiki seragam.","hi":"repairs"},{"en":"I am a beginner.","translation":"Aku pemula.","hi":"am"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"He baker.","right":"He is a baker."},{"wrong":"She is cooks at home.","right":"She cooks at home."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Katakan: «Penjahit itu memperbaiki seragam».","answer":["The","tailor","repairs","uniforms"],"distractors":["is","repair"]}}]},{"num":"10","title":"Kesalahan yang dibuat hampir semua orang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She wait at the bus stop.","right":"She waits at the bus stop."},{"wrong":"I am work in a pharmacy.","right":"I work in a pharmacy."},{"wrong":"I works at home.","right":"I work at home."},{"wrong":"She teachs English.","right":"She teaches English."},{"wrong":"She studys with a tutor.","right":"She studies with a tutor."},{"wrong":"He baker.","right":"He is a baker."},{"wrong":"I start in two.","right":"I start at two."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Dua cek. Ada kegiatan — buang am, is, are. Kalau he, she, it, atau satu orang — tambah s."}]},{"num":"11","title":"Bekal untuk latihan","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Siapa + kegiatan, tanpa penjepit. I, you, we, they — kegiatan seperti di kamus. He, she, it — tambah s, kadang es atau ies. Tempat dan waktu di akhir, jam pakai at."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"We pack the bags.","translation":"Kami mengemas tas.","hi":"pack"},{"en":"He coughs.","translation":"Dia batuk.","hi":"coughs"},{"en":"She catches the bus.","translation":"Dia sempat naik bus.","hi":"catches"},{"en":"She studies with a tutor.","translation":"Dia belajar dengan guru les.","hi":"studies"},{"en":"I arrive at five.","translation":"Aku sampai jam lima.","hi":"arrive"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{}}
